# ACE OS package selection.
# Kept deliberately lean: the target machine has 4 GB RAM and 128 GB eMMC.

## Desktop (XFCE — light enough for 4 GB RAM)
task-xfce-desktop
task-laptop
lightdm
xfce4-power-manager
xfce4-screenshooter
xfce4-taskmanager
mousepad
ristretto
xarchiver
thunar-archive-plugin

## Installer (graphical, beginner-friendly)
calamares
calamares-settings-debian

## Dark "BlackArch" look
greybird-gtk-theme
papirus-icon-theme
fonts-firacode

## Everyday apps
firefox-esr
vlc
gnome-disk-utility
gparted

## Terminal stack
htop
tmux
ncdu
tree
neovim
git
curl
wget
unzip
ca-certificates

## Local AI runtime (the llama.cpp engine is added by the build workflow)
libgomp1
python3
python3-pip

## Hardware support for the ASUS L510M (Gemini Lake platform)
firmware-linux
firmware-iwlwifi
firmware-realtek
firmware-atheros
firmware-sof-signed
intel-microcode
intel-media-va-driver

## Performance on low RAM / eMMC
zram-tools
